gadx(){return"Mr. President, we need to have a talk about the transfer budget."},
gadz(){return"Mr. President, we need to put the stadium issue on the agenda right away."},
gadA(){return"Mr. President, there is an important matter regarding the training facilities."},
gadB(){return"Mr. President, I would like to discuss an investment plan for the club academy."},
