gads(){return"Let's talk transfer budget"},
gadu(){return"We should expand the stadium"},
gadv(){return"Let's upgrade the training facility"},
gadw(){return"The academy needs investment"},
gadt(){return"I want to discuss my contract"},
gadR(){return"Your current squad does not look bad at all, boss. Why do you need an extra transfer budget, could you explain?"},
gadT(){return"Taking on a stadium project is a huge investment. What is the rationale for this move, and why right now?"},
gadU(){return"I think our facilities are perfectly adequate. Can you tell me precisely what you find lacking?"},
gadV(){return"The academy is a long-term business, as you know. What makes it a priority now, why should we move it up?"},
gadS(){return"Contracts are a delicate subject, boss. What exactly are you expecting to change?"},
gadC(){return"We need a little more room to manoeuvre if we are to be effective in the transfer market, Mr. President."},
gadD(){return"There are gaps in our squad and we need to close them mid-season."},
gadE(){return"Our rivals are not standing still, so we have to move too. We do not want to fall behind."},
gadI(){return"Our capacity will fall short in the long run, so we should be planning for it now."},
gadJ(){return"A modern stadium means both prestige and revenue. An investment in the future."},
gadK(){return"If we want to be a big club, our infrastructure has to be big as well."},
gadL(){return"The current facilities are inadequate; our players are not getting what they deserve."},
gadM(){return"The equipment is behind the times. Modern gear is essential for performance."},
gadN(){return"The training environment matters enormously for player psychology; we must invest."},
gadO(){return"Our academy facilities are more than ten years old; neither the bed capacity nor the pitch quality meets today's standards."},
gadP(){return"For three seasons we have promoted zero players from the U19s to the first team; if that trend continues our transfer costs will multiply."},
gadQ(){return"Producing our own talent is strategically important in the long run, both for financial sustainability and for the club's identity, Mr. President."},
gadF(){return"There is a season and a half left on my current contract; I need longer-term security so that I can plan ahead."},
gadG(){return"Given last season's success and the responsibility we shouldered, I believe I deserve an adjustment on the salary side too."},
gadH(){return"I also expect clarity on authority: the final word on transfers being mine, and less interference from the sporting director."},
gae5(){return"I understand, boss, and I accept the situation. Our coffers are a little tight, but I will speak to the board and come back to you with a concrete figure within a few days."},
gae7(){return"You have fair points, and this is a club-wide matter. I will call an extraordinary board meeting on architectural feasibility and financing options, and get back to you as soon as I can."},
gae8(){return"What you say makes sense, and I have been getting similar signals in recent months. Let us review the budget and sit down together over the facility plan."},
gae9(){return"Thinking long term is difficult, admittedly, but necessary. Let us hold a separate meeting next week with the academy director and yourself."},
gae6(){return"You know that we want to work with you for many years. I will have our lawyers prepare a draft and we can meet again next week."},
